message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MusicXML Discovery: Rights-Aware GitHub Harvesting and Tonal Polyphony Screening"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-30
authors:
  - family-names: Fresquet
    given-names: Xavier
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8362-9485"
repository-code: "https://github.com/captaldebuch/musicxml-discovery"
url: "https://github.com/captaldebuch/musicxml-discovery"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - MusicXML
  - symbolic music
  - dataset discovery
  - computational musicology
  - tonality
  - polyphony
abstract: >-
  A dependency-light command-line workflow for discovering MusicXML files in
  rights-approved GitHub repositories, preserving commit-pinned provenance and
  licensing evidence and reuse constraints, including non-commercial sources,
  and screening candidates for tonal content and concurrent encoded voices.
